01:30:53.340 --> 01:30:54.173
- Oh, great.

01:30:54.173 --> 01:30:55.391
- I don't know if the mic is on.

01:30:55.391 --> 01:30:58.134
- [Female] Oh, is it not? Okay, oh.

01:30:58.134 --> 01:30:59.157
- [Male] Yeah, maybe it turned off.

01:30:59.157 --> 01:31:00.835
