01:31:00.835 --> 01:31:01.964
Is the microphone on?

01:31:01.964 --> 01:31:05.243
(female chatters indistinctly)

01:31:05.243 --> 01:31:06.580
- Maybe this one?
- Wanna use this mic?

01:31:06.580 --> 01:31:07.763
You wanna just...

01:31:07.763 --> 01:31:08.596
- (chuckles) sorry, yeah.

01:31:08.596 --> 01:31:09.429
- There's also a mic here.

01:31:09.429 --> 01:31:11.690
- I'm just thinking for
the people online too.

01:31:11.690 --> 01:31:15.032
Yeah, I'm worse with technology, trust me.

01:31:15.032 --> 01:31:16.642
(female chatters indistinctly)

01:31:16.642 --> 01:31:19.190
(Elizabeth and Derecka chuckle)

01:31:19.190 --> 01:31:20.491
- No, no, no, that's not a microphone-

01:31:20.491 --> 01:31:21.459
- That microphone-

01:31:21.459 --> 01:31:22.292
(crosstalk drowns out speaker)

01:31:22.292 --> 01:31:23.139
